  "display_title": "Daughter of a Superstar",
  "description": "Ru-Min is an acting prodigy with a Newtube channel that often goes viral. As it happens, she is also the spitting image of her favorite A-list actor Ha-Jin Jeong. A shocking turn of events reveals that Ha-Jin is actually Ru-Min’s biological father. The cold-hearted actor reluctantly takes her in, but pointedly vows no affection. However, as Ru-Min’s raw talent shines, Ha-Jin finds himself becoming an unlikely mentor. Having long fantasized about Ha-Jin being her father, can Ru-Min finally make her dreams a reality?\n\n(Source: WEBTOON)",
